title: "MoleculeFinder: the molecules in everyday foods, drinks and products"
abstract: >-
  The molecules in everyday foods, drinks and products: molecules with their PubChem identity and properties, Wikidata items and names,
  MoleculeFinder's descriptions and groups, LD50 values from US government sources, and the
  foods, drinks and products that list them. CC0 1.0.
